There's a lot more to show. I'll try to be posting as much as possible along the development to let everyone know how it's going.

Raf

Hi guys, the first major update is here!

What's new:

. new map "Maincity center" with 5 reactors and 4 enemy bases to overcome;
. Joystick controller support;
. the enemies' AI were reformulated;
. camera post-effects and color grading were improved;
. the HUD scale can be adjusted;
. item drops were balanced and limited;
. next mission button to skip the headquarters after victory;
. more enemy guards are to be found around the maps;
. tutorial hints are improved;
. game engine version updated;
. optimizations and bug-fixes;

Under the Gameplay tab there are the Normal and Hard difficulty modes. Hard mode will increase enemy hitpoints and max units limit.

To enable the controller, you may need to re-configure the Input in the startup dialog -> Input tab. Then go to the Main Headquarters -> Game settings -> Controls, select Joystick, configure the Auto-Aim distance and sensibility.

Find more info on this update in the community forum.
I'll compile a list for the most urgent fixes and release another minor update soon. 

Hope you like it, Thanks!

